#21652=IFCPROPERTYSINGLEVALUE('Description',$,IFCTEXT('Tessera Perspective is a 50 x 50 cm cut & loop pile carpet tile collection that consists of 8 neutral tones complemented by 6 rich, decadent accent colours. Each colour tone combines two yarn colours, creating a modern, softly striated design.

Forbo\X2\2019\X0\s carpet tiles are designed and manufactured with various pile constructions to give specific aesthetic and performance benefits. Cut and loop pile tiles feature a clever hybrid construction that offers all the robustness of a conventional loop pile product but with the superior aesthetics and more luxurious feel of a cut pile carpet tile. 

Benefits: \X2\2022\X0\ 100% Universal solution-dyed Nylon 66 and Nylon 6, for class 33 durability and colour fastness \X2\2022\X0\ 670 gsm pile weight ensures underfoot comfort and durability \X2\2022\X0\ monolithic installation giving the appearance of a broadloom installation \X2\2022\X0\ 65% recycled content by weight \X2\2022\X0\ high acoustic value of 25 dB for minimal noise transmission \X2\2022\X0\ meets Ska criteria for M12 soft floor coverings \X2\2022\X0\ easy to combine with Allura Flex luxury vinyl tiles using the same adhesive and without the need for transition strips, additional profiles or inconvenient build-up of the sub-floor'),$);
